{"slug":"Universal-Script-FE-Telekinesis-(With-network-ownership)-231231","_id":"6ac19f007927a454224b3f25","title":"FE Telekinesis (With network ownership)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1791074048057.png","placeId":0},"features":"-- Controls & Keybinds:\n\nLeft Click (Hold): Grabs and lifts the object. (Releasing it drops the object).\n\nQ: Pulls the object closer to you.\n\nE: Pushes the object further away.\n\nT: Instantly snaps the object right in front of you (10 units away).\n\nY: Instantly launches the object far away (200 units).\n\n+ (Equals =): Increases magnet strength! If a player jumps onto the object and it starts sinking, press this 1-2 times. It powers up the object to shoot like a bullet.\n\n- (Minus -): Decreases magnet strength.\n\nR: If the object tilts or goes off-axis while holding it mid-air, press R. It levels the object perfectly flat like a table and locks its rotation.","tags":["fe","network ownership","telekinesis","open source"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/boreaxdev/f9f464cd919c053d05e650b644fe60e8/raw/fe-telekinesis.lua'))()","owner":{"_id":"6a2a80d7700a4ec20bf56fec","username":"Boreax","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a2a80d7700a4ec20bf56fec-1781349640153.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6a2a80d7700a4ec20bf56fec","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"views":304,"executes":92,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1791074048057.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-04T00:34:08.239Z","editBy":{"_id":"6a2a80d7700a4ec20bf56fec","username":"Boreax","status":"offline","id":"6a2a80d7700a4ec20bf56fec"},"keyLink":"","reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-09T11:56:40.660Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false